SolarMatrix WohnStrom Manager -- security model

This device is hardened against remote attackers and against anyone
without tools. It is deliberately NOT hardened against physical access
with tools: the MediaTek BootROM accepts code over the front USB-C serial
port at power-on, and the flash can be read with a clip. Those limits
were chosen, not overlooked.

What that gives an attacker: this one unit. Every secret on it is unique
to it, and its certificate can be revoked.

